उद्-धर्षिन्, ई, इणी, इ, Ved. whose hair is erected;
(इणी), f., N. of a metre of four verses, of fourteen
syllables each.

उद्धा 2. उद्-धा (उद्-हा), cl. 3. A. उज्-जिहीते,
उद्-धातुम्, to go upwards, move upwards; to raise;
to go away from.

उद्-धर्तृ, ता, त्री, तृ, one who raises or lifts up;
a sharer, a coheir; one who recovers property; (ता),
m. a destroyer, exterminator; redeemer, deliverer.
